Veritly's document and presentation editors are based on GenOffice,
originally developed by Mainfunc, Inc. (https://genspark.ai/).

The original source code is available at:
https://github.com/genspark-ai/genoffice

GenOffice is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file for the full license text and NOTICE for the attribution
notices Apache-2.0 section 4(d) requires to be carried forward.

This checkout is a fork tracking the `veritly` branch of
https://github.com/mixinDennisBarzanoffMixin/genoffice. It differs from
upstream in one respect: the `ee/` directory, which upstream distributes
under the separate GenOffice Enterprise License, has been removed so that
everything vendored here is Apache-2.0.
